<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY C.BANK TO PUBLISH MARCH C/A ON JUNE 6.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY C.BANK TO PUBLISH MARCH C/A ON JUNE 6.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary said on Friday that it would publish March 1997 current account figures on June 6.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 32704040</p>
